# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Powers the conversational intake at /start.
#
# WITHOUT this key the page still works — it falls back to a scripted
# question flow that collects the same brief, draws the same sketch and
# produces the same planning range. What you lose is the ability to
# understand free-form answers ("a little cabin by the lake for guests").
#
# Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# On Vercel: Project Settings → Environment Variables.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
